{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "stereo",
 "version": "0.9",
 "title": "Stereo samples",
 "description": "Stereo WAVs upload through Transfer as stereo and play in stereo. Stereo upload is an option and can be switched to stock state in Config -> Device -> Upload setting. In Track setup menu ([FUNC] + [TRACK]) added option Chan, that sets track playback mode as MONO or STEREO (ST)",
